\pard\sb160\sa100\f1\fs26\cf1 TROUBLESHOOTING\par
\pard\sb70\sa65\f1\fs21\cf6\b The viewer shows an empty area\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs20\cf10 Confirm that the RTF file was extracted and that the FMXBridge DLL was built for the same architecture as the Inno Setup process. This test uses a local RTF file and does not require a network connection.\par
\pard\sb70\sa65\f1\fs21\cf6\b Text appears but the picture does not\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs20\cf10 Picture support depends on the installed RichEdit implementation. The banner is embedded as a PNG picture destination in this RTF file; it is not loaded from a separate image path.\par
\pard\sb70\sa65\f1\fs21\cf6\b Links do not open a browser\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0\fs20\cf10 This demo deliberately intercepts link clicks and displays the clicked text in a message box. It does not launch a browser. A separate test can use AutoOpenLink(True) to check the default ShellExecuteW path.\par

